	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Construis le rectangle ${{if:s==0|A|}}{{if:s==1|E|}}{{if:s==2|M|}}{{if:s==3|R|}}{{if:s==0|B|}}{{if:s==1|F|}}{{if:s==2|N|}}{{if:s==3|S|}}{{if:s==0|C|}}{{if:s==1|G|}}{{if:s==2|P|}}{{if:s==3|T|}}{{if:s==0|D|}}{{if:s==1|H|}}{{if:s==2|Q|}}{{if:s==3|U|}}$ tel que ${{if:s==0|A|}}{{if:s==1|E|}}{{if:s==2|M|}}{{if:s==3|R|}}{{if:s==0|B|}}{{if:s==1|F|}}{{if:s==2|N|}}{{if:s==3|S|}} = {{eval:ab/10;d}}$ cm et ${{if:s==0|A|}}{{if:s==1|E|}}{{if:s==2|M|}}{{if:s==3|R|}}{{if:s==0|C|}}{{if:s==1|G|}}{{if:s==2|P|}}{{if:s==3|T|}} = {{eval:ac/10;d}}$ cm, sans équerre. La diagonale $[{{if:s==0|A|}}{{if:s==1|E|}}{{if:s==2|M|}}{{if:s==3|R|}}{{if:s==0|C|}}{{if:s==1|G|}}{{if:s==2|P|}}{{if:s==3|T|}}]$ est tracée.\n\n```figure-a-completer\nfenetre: 0 ; 12 ; 0 ; 9\nverifier: rectangle {{if:s==0|A|}}{{if:s==1|E|}}{{if:s==2|M|}}{{if:s==3|R|}} ; {{if:s==0|B|}}{{if:s==1|F|}}{{if:s==2|N|}}{{if:s==3|S|}} ; {{if:s==0|C|}}{{if:s==1|G|}}{{if:s==2|P|}}{{if:s==3|T|}} ; {{if:s==0|D|}}{{if:s==1|H|}}{{if:s==2|Q|}}{{if:s==3|U|}} : {{if:s==0|A|}}{{if:s==1|E|}}{{if:s==2|M|}}{{if:s==3|R|}}{{if:s==0|B|}}{{if:s==1|F|}}{{if:s==2|N|}}{{if:s==3|S|}} = {{eval:ab/10;d}} cm ; {{if:s==0|A|}}{{if:s==1|E|}}{{if:s==2|M|}}{{if:s==3|R|}}{{if:s==0|C|}}{{if:s==1|G|}}{{if:s==2|P|}}{{if:s==3|T|}} = {{eval:ac/10;d}} cm\n---\n{{if:s==0|A|}}{{if:s==1|E|}}{{if:s==2|M|}}{{if:s==3|R|}} = point({{eval:(120-ac)/20;d}}, 4.5, etiquette=\"gauche\")\n{{if:s==0|C|}}{{if:s==1|G|}}{{if:s==2|P|}}{{if:s==3|T|}} = point({{eval:(120+ac)/20;d}}, 4.5, etiquette=\"droite\")\nd = segment({{if:s==0|A|}}{{if:s==1|E|}}{{if:s==2|M|}}{{if:s==3|R|}}, {{if:s==0|C|}}{{if:s==1|G|}}{{if:s==2|P|}}{{if:s==3|T|}})\n```",
			"variables": [
